commit 3f51f134bc574ea04d02471740ab0cad2ff38ace
Author: Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>
Date:   Tue Jan 13 13:56:28 2026 +0100

    Port to fuse3

    Switch to the libfuse3 API (FUSE_USE_VERSION 30) and require fuse3.

    Besides the signature changes, handle fuse3's different runtime defaults:
    - Disable FUSE_CAP_ATOMIC_O_TRUNC in init(): open() doesn't handle O_TRUNC,
      so overwriting an existing file would leave stale trailing data.
    - utimens() now gets UTIME_NOW/UTIME_OMIT with tv_sec == 0; resolve them
      so touch no longer sets mtime to 1970 (and touch -a leaves it alone).
    - libfuse >= 3.12 caps worker threads at 10, while reads block until the
      file is downloaded; default to -o max_threads=64 (user value wins).
    - rename() rejects RENAME_NOREPLACE/RENAME_EXCHANGE with -EINVAL.

    Update README and debian/control (libfuse3-dev, fuse3).

